      "writtenOn": "2020-11-18T22:33:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "isn\u0027t PAC/BTI in the same bucket as some of the production ubsan flags we use? an optional hardening feature that we turn on in various places (for now).\n\nwe use `sanitize: { integer_overflow: true }` to turn on intoverflow in prod, for example.\n\n`sanitize: {}` doesn\u0027t have the whole \"enforced\" mode, but we have `sanitize: { diag: {} }`, so we could do `sanitize: { enforced: ...`",
      "revId": "28c42baead08b6a8450ad4c33eb28c5f785d35f9",
