      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"BTI must be enabled in everything that is linked into the same DSO\"\nThis true, mutator enables all decencies because runtime loading a less protected library is less secure :) original idea was for enforced to run the \"SecurityCriticalApp\" process as protected as possible, loading a non BTI protected shared lib just mark the location of the gadgets.",
      "parentUuid": "6f185ea6_3b46cbd5",
      "revId": "28c42baead08b6a8450ad4c33eb28c5f785d35f9",
