      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T08:41:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Daniel,\n\nWe discussed about this some more internally and concluded that we want:\n1) Independent options for PAC/BTI.\n2) Nested under the \"sanitize\" label.\n\nIn summary, our suggestion is to have something that looks like:\n\nsanitize: {\n    sign_pointers: true, // alternatively, pointer_signatures\n    check_indirect_branches: true, // alternatively, hardware_cfi\n}\n\nHope that\u0027s not too much rework at your end.",
      "revId": "28c42baead08b6a8450ad4c33eb28c5f785d35f9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
